(text "Front panel (J24, pairs from the west): RESET (J10.17), OSD (J10.13), USER (J10.15): signal + GND,\n10k pull-up to 3V3, button to GND. LED USER (J10.1), LED DISK (J10.3), LED POWER (J10.5):\n3V3 - 1k - LED - FPGA pin. The I/O Board may already have pull-ups/LEDs on these pins (in parallel)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 426.72 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "691a3c7c-597d-5ded-877b-7581f6e45ea8"))
